Package: perufauna
Title: Easily Load and Harmonize Peruvian Fauna and Biodiversity Packages
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Paul E.", "Santos Andrade", , 
    "paulefrens@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375"))
Description: A metapackage providing an integrated toolkit to load, 
    cross-reference, and validate biodiversity data for Peruvian fauna across
    specialized taxonomic backbones (avesperu, perumammals) and regulatory 
    threat frameworks (citesperu, perufaunads004).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    avesperu,
    citesperu,
    cli,
    perufaunads004,
    perumammals,
    rlang,
    tibble
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/PaulESantos/perufauna, https://paulesantos.github.io/perufauna/
BugReports: https://github.com/PaulESantos/perufauna/issues
